Abilities.htm#poison\">Poison</a>&nbsp;(Kills; Fortitude partial, take&nbsp;<a class=\"diceRoller\" title=\"Roll the dice!\">1d6</a>&nbsp;points of Con damage instead)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">5</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Blue</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Turned to stone (Fortitude negates)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">6</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Indigo</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Insane, as&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.d20srd.org/srd/spells/insanity.htm\">insanity</a>&nbsp;spell (Will negates)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">7</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Violet</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Sent to another plane (Will negates)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">8</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\" colspan=\"2\">Struck by two rays; roll twice more, ignoring any &ldquo;8&rdquo; results.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
